source: tests/sync/write_lib.rs
expression: apply(&switch)
---
## Switch

```
branches:
  - lib (or)
  - link (or)
  - napi (or) cargo_features=["node"]
  - rustdoc (xor) env_flags=["rust_curse_rustdoc"]
```

## Output

### lib.rs

```rust
// prelude

#[cfg(not(rust_curse_rustdoc))]
include!("link.rs");

#[cfg(all(feature = "node", not(rust_curse_rustdoc)))]
include!("napi.rs");

#[cfg(rust_curse_rustdoc)]
include!("rustdoc.rs");
```

